   ```cpp
   #include <gsCore/gsTemplateTools.h>
   CLASS_TEMPLATE_INST gsTensorNurbsBasis<1,real_t>;
   CLASS_TEMPLATE_INST gsTensorNurbsBasis<2,real_t>;
   CLASS_TEMPLATE_INST gsTensorNurbsBasis<3,real_t>;
   CLASS_TEMPLATE_INST gsTensorNurbsBasis<4,real_t>;
   ```
   Without these, including `gsTensorNurbsBasis.hpp` emits no code. The `namespace gismo { }` block contains only a comment, so the object file holds no `gsTensorNurbsBasis` symbols.

